      "description": "Filled resume action with semantic colors for both themes.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-primary\" href=\"#resume\">View resume <svg width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4M7 10l5 5 5-5M12 15V3\"/></svg></a>",
      "css": ".ds-primary{font-family:var(--font-portfolio,Cambay),sans-serif;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:9px;min-height:48px;padding:10px 16px 8px;border:1px solid hsl(var(--primary,184 86% 23%));border-radius:var(--radius,.375rem);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.6;text-decoration:none;transition:background-color 150ms,color 150ms;background:hsl(var(--primary,184 86% 23%));color:hsl(var(--primary-foreground,0 0% 100%));}.ds-primary:hover{background:hsl(var(--foreground,224 70% 12%));border-color:hsl(var(--foreground,224 70% 12%));color:hsl(var(--background,0 0% 100%));}.ds-primary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid hsl(var(--ring,184 86% 23%));outline-offset:5px;border-radius:3px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-primary,.ds-secondary,.ds-project svg{transition:none;}}"
    },
