  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Modern Precision",
    "overview": "Modern Precision presents professional work with clear sans-serif type, restrained teal actions, and broad areas of quiet space. Navy headings and steel-blue supporting copy establish a direct reading hierarchy. The same roles carry into a dark navy theme.\n\nThe page is compact and left-aligned on phones. Wider views center the introductory statement and its actions while maintaining left-aligned reading columns for supporting content. Real portrait and project imagery appears within the content; it does not compete with the introduction.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "A single self-hosted type family with regular and bold weights.",
      "Flat, full-width tonal bands with fine dividers.",
